1
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,810
There are indeed many suspicious things
about Wen Yanhui's past.

2
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:14,160
His original name is Chen Hui.

3
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,830
Back in the last century,

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,720
he was a famous male model
at the Xinggang Dance Hall.

5
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,990
There, he met

6
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:21,820
the richest woman in Xinggang
at the time, Wen Yan.

7
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,090
Wen Yan fell in love with Chen Hui
at first sight.

8
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:26,430
She insisted on marrying him
despite the rumors,

9
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:28,290
and gave birth to a child, Wen Xin.

10
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,390
She also brought him into

11
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:31,570
the Wen Group,
which she founded single-handedly.

12
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:32,770
But a few years later,

13
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,690
on the eve of the board election,

14
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,730
Wen Yan was involved in a traffic accident

15
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,060
and died unexpectedly.

16
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:39,430
To commemorate his late wife, Chen Hui

17
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:40,860
changed his name to Wen Yanhui.

18
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:41,860
And the Wen Group

19
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,820
completely became his property.

20
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,470
A familiar car accident,

21
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,000
and a familiar accidental death.

22
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,320
It's highly likely that

23
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,710
he climbed the ladder step by step,
relying on women.

24
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:55,030
Now everyone says

25
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,750
the Wen Group belongs to Wen Yanhui.

26
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:58,350
But no one remembers

27
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:01,600
that this Group was built by a woman.

28
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:04,120
There aren't that many accidents
in this world.

29
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:04,790
Hao,

30
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:06,560
go find out

31
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:09,010
what exactly happened to Wen Yan's death.

32
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:10,070
So,

33
00:01:11,830 --> 00:01:14,060
this is what you care about
the most right now?

34
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:15,580
Boss died for you.

35
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:17,340
Why aren't you sad at all?

36
00:01:25,830 --> 00:01:26,960
Jiang Yu and I

37
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,310
are great partners.

38
00:01:32,789 --> 00:01:34,509
And I believe he'll be fine.

39
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,539
Before the explosion,

40
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,710
he must have already left the factory.

41
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:40,950
But we can't find him.

42
00:01:47,130 --> 00:01:50,610
Jiang Yu is a great partner.

43
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,350
If he really had an accident,

44
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:55,240
I'd be very sorry too.

45
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:56,400
But Hao,

46
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:57,950
I have to apologize to you.

47
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:59,070
I have to continue.

48
00:01:59,509 --> 00:02:00,790
I have to continue

49
00:02:01,150 --> 00:02:03,760
and find all the killers
who murdered Jiang Yuqing

50
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,310
and make them pay.

51
00:02:05,790 --> 00:02:07,040
This is something

52
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,930
I owe myself

53
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:10,130
and your Boss.

54
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:11,630
Boss is so foolish.

55
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:13,500
How could he fall in love with

56
00:02:14,330 --> 00:02:16,530
such a cold and ruthless woman like you?

57
00:02:20,510 --> 00:02:23,040
There is something Boss left for you
in the secret room.

58
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:25,640
I will continue to investigate
Wen Yan's case.

59
00:02:26,150 --> 00:02:27,300
Actually, before the operation,

60
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:28,900
Boss had already made a will.

61
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,400
If anything happened to him,

62
00:02:31,829 --> 00:02:34,720
the entire Cloudsea would be yours.

63
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,079
From now on,

64
00:02:37,450 --> 00:02:39,100
I will also take orders from you.

65
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:40,579
This is what I owe Boss.

66
00:02:47,620 --> 00:02:49,350
[Dearest Episode 14]

67
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,620
To my love, Jianan,

68
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:03,600
I have been drawn to you my whole life.

69
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,160
From a brief encounter at 16,

70
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,490
I unconsciously fell in love with you.

71
00:04:17,149 --> 00:04:19,040
When my mother had a car accident,

72
00:04:20,310 --> 00:04:22,110
all the evidence pointed to you.

73
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,670
I could only hide my love

74
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:30,350
and approach you again.

75
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:52,310
I once thought

76
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:55,640
getting close to you again
was for revenge.

77
00:04:56,390 --> 00:04:57,720
Only later did I realize

78
00:04:59,070 --> 00:04:59,600
that meeting you

79
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,860
was the luckiest twist of fate in my life.

80
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:06,540
I left everything I have to you.

81
00:05:07,770 --> 00:05:09,500
But what I want to leave you most

82
00:05:09,830 --> 00:05:11,560
is a clean version of myself

83
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,050
and a real wedding.

84
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,160
One day,

85
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,040
if I can truly become your groom,

86
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:21,120
I hope

87
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,950
we will no longer have hatred

88
00:05:23,450 --> 00:05:24,780
or secrets at that time.

89
00:05:26,510 --> 00:05:27,590
Only love

90
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:31,480
can connect our hearts.

91
00:05:48,690 --> 00:05:52,010
Jiang Yu, I will definitely find you.

92
00:06:16,210 --> 00:06:18,600
Jianan, Jianan.

93
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:29,040
Miss Mingzhu.

94
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,280
Don't push yourself, Alex.

95
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:40,560
What are you doing here?

96
00:06:42,190 --> 00:06:43,310
Long time no see.

97
00:06:44,270 --> 00:06:47,030
The last time I saw you was in Cloudsea.

98
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,760
At that time, you were drinking with me.

99
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,360
So what do you want to say?

100
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:54,380
Of course I want to cure you.

101
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,130
If it weren't for me,

102
00:06:56,350 --> 00:06:58,990
you would have been
killed by those desperadoes.

103
00:06:58,990 --> 00:07:00,390
You've been spying on me.

104
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:03,120
If not,

105
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:04,600
why would your men

106
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,600
happen to be there to save me?

107
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,140
I always keep a close eye on

108
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:15,100
the one I like.

109
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,310
Besides,

110
00:07:20,390 --> 00:07:22,590
you can't even save yourself right now.

111
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:24,160
As for me,

112
00:07:24,810 --> 00:07:25,930
I am willing

113
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,640
to give you a chance to redeem yourself.

114
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:31,360
Mr. Alex, are you

115
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,190
willing to cooperate?

116
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:38,950
Have a rest.

117
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,420
What's the date today?

118
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:44,800
March 16.

119
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,770
Until you are fully recovered,

120
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,060
don't even think about leaving here.

121
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,920
Ten days left.

122
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:02,390
I must get better

123
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:05,670
and escape from this place.

124
00:08:36,710 --> 00:08:37,710
Hello, Boss.

125
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:50,970
Jiang Yu, I will protect Cloudsea for you.

126
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:54,990
And I will never spare those
who harmed you.
